# config file
                                     
    // hiscore_file: the name of the file the hiscore data will stored in
    // levels: array of each level data
    //         each level become harder when the maze become bigger
    // width: maze width in each level
    // height: maze height in each level
    // player_lives: how many time a player can retry in one level (before the time ends)
    // pacgum_points: the value of each pacgum
    // supergum_points: the value of each super_pacgum
    // gost_points: the value of each ghost eaten
    // level_max_time: the maximum time of each level, if it ends before the player wins, the player loses

